summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans bg-brand-cream text-brand-navy flex flex-col min-h-screen __variable_0d7163 __variable_5667dc\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full\"><div class=\"bg-brand-cream/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brand-navy/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm group-hover:bg-brand-lime transition-colors duration-300\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-brand-cream group-hover:fill-brand-navy transition-colors duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy tracking-tight group-hover:text-brand-navy/70 transition-colors\">TugasMu</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/tools\">AI Tools</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/90 text-brand-cream font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/masuk\">Masuk / Daftar</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-full text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></header><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b\"><div class=\"container py-3\"><nav class=\"flex text-sm text-slate-500\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-3\"><li class=\"inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><span class=\"text-slate-900 font-medium\" aria-current=\"page\">Kontak</span></div></li></ol></nav></div></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container py-12 md:py-20 max-w-4xl\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\"><div><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6\">Hubungi Kami</h1><p class=\"text-slate-600 mb-8 text-lg\">Ada pertanyaan, masalah, atau ingin memberi saran fitur baru? Jangan ragu untuk menghubungi kami.</p><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">Email</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600\">support@tugasmu.com</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">Waktu Operasional</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Senin - Jumat: 09:00 - 17:00 WIB</p><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Kami berusaha membalas pesanmu dalam 1-2 hari kerja.</p></div><div class=\"pt-6 border-t\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Untuk Kemitraan &amp; Media</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Tertarik bekerja sama atau meliput TugasMu? Email kami di <span class=\"font-medium\">partners@tugasmu.com</span>.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-heading font-bold mb-6\">Kirim Pesan</h2><form class=\"space-y-4\"><div><label for=\"name\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1\">Nama Lengkap</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border-slate-300 border p-2.5 focus:ring-sky-500 focus:border-sky-500\" placeholder=\"Cth: Budi Santoso\" required=\"\"/></div><div><label for=\"email\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1\">Email</label><input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border-slate-300 border p-2.5 focus:ring-sky-500 focus:border-sky-500\" placeholder=\"budi@example.com\" required=\"\"/></div><div><label for=\"subject\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1\">Subjek</label><select id=\"subject\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border-slate-300 border p-2.5 focus:ring-sky-500 focus:border-sky-500\"><option>Pertanyaan Umum</option><option>Laporan Bug / Error</option><option>Saran Fitur Baru</option><option>Pertanyaan Guru Kontributor</option></select></div><div><label for=\"message\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1\">Pesan</label><textarea id=\"message\" rows=\"4\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border-slate-300 border p-2.5 focus:ring-sky-500 focus:border-sky-500\" placeholder=\"Tulis pesanmu di sini...\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full bg-sky-600 text-white font-medium py-3 px-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-sky-700 transition-colors\">Kirim Pesan</button></form></div></div></div></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-heading\">TugasMu.com</span></div><span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500\">© 2026 TugasMu.com. Hak cipta dilindungi.</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Beranda</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/privasi\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/syarat\">Terms of Service</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/kontak\">Kontak</a></div></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-37f8c22e297b04f8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/c70a6d8e0709b465.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n2:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/7eb325243a3b1d61.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3:I[2846,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[4707,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[6423,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:I[8003,[\\\"3433\\\",\\\"static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\\\",\\\"2972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2972-8ce94bd856f9372b.js\\\",\\\"3185\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-c819fc26cf8b0e32.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:I[9314,[\\\"3433\\\",\\\"static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\\\",\\\"2972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2972-8ce94bd856f9372b.js\\\",\\\"3185\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-c819fc26cf8b0e32.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n9:I[6454,[\\\"3433\\\",\\\"static/chunks/3433-9ddc